csq_soln_mode = 'index' 
csq_soln = 2 
csq_explanation = 'Including the first element sets a threshold the next pick must beat. We capture that with the last chosen value (call it prev).' 
</question>

Great—so our subproblem needs a threshold. Let’s make that explicit in our goal.

### 🚦 Question 4 — Rewrite the goal with prev
